# Scratch fetch artifacts.
#
# Research agents curl pages while working and occasionally write the output into
# the repo root instead of the session scratchpad. Those dumps are scraped
# third-party HTML, not account data, and must never be committed to this repo —
# it is private target-account intelligence, not a page cache.
#
# Deliberately scoped to the repository ROOT only, so a genuine .html or .json
# that ever belongs inside a pipeline folder is still tracked normally.
/*.html
/*.json
/*.xls
/*.xlsx

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
